tion of the\nGCL_FINDING: The exact public candidate documents delimit the claimed transport results and their remaining obligations. This is source inspection, not a fresh Lean replay or admission of the candidate.\nGCL_NEXT: Bind subsequent proof verification to the specific unresolved obligation in the candidate reports and its exact formal source.\n"}],"withheld_candidates":0}
